invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_ifma_sign.c
catches: proof/prove-one.sh rsa_ifma_sign_power
reason: the exponentiation runs one step more than the exponent has
  digits, so table_select reads the byte past the exponent's end and the
  power is raised once more. The rsa_ifma_sign_power proof runs
  rsa_ifma_sign_power_pair whole and checks every read of the exponent.

--- old
    for (size_t i = 0; i < 2 * e_len; i++) {
--- new
    for (size_t i = 0; i < 2 * e_len + 1; i++) {
